<p>The signature Persol Arrow detail adds an unmistakable finishing touch, while the flexible temple construction brings comfort to the frame's strong aesthetic. Crafted in Italy, the PO0649 is a timeless choice for those who appreciate authentic design and exceptional craftsmanship.</p>
