{"products":[{"id":10387129532696,"title":"Prada PR 15WS","handle":"prada-pr-15ws","body_html":"\u003ch2\u003ePR 15WS\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrada PR 15WS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003egives the classic rectangular frame a distinctly feminine and fashion-forward update. Its bold acetate construction creates a confident silhouette, while the clean lines keep the overall design polished and sophisticated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a selection of rich tortoise and classic black finishes paired with dark or gradient lenses, the PR 15WS adds effortless Prada style to any look. Its balanced proportions make it a versatile choice for everyday wear, while the strong frame gives it enough presence to stand out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHighlights\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBold rectangular silhouette\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium acetate construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFull-rim design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDistinctive Prada styling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in classic and tortoise finishes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSolid and gradient lens options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e54-19-140 size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-22T16:00:45-04:00","created_at":"2026-08-22T16:00:44-04:00","updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:05:08-04:00","vendor":"EyeQ Vision Care","product_type":"","tags":["sun"],"varian
